OL,3,GNEWSAMan waited months for cancer
OL,4,Aletter due to postal delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has described waiting five months
OL,7,Ffor a hospital letter about a cancer
OL,8,Fconsultation amid widespread postal
OL,9,Fdelays.
OL,11,FJohn Goode, 79, from Bulkington,
OL,12,FWarwickshire, was among a number of
OL,13,Fpeople from across the West Midlands
OL,14,Fwho told the BBC they had spent weeks
OL,15,Fwaiting for Royal Mail deliveries.
OL,17,FIn Rugby, Warwickshire, residents have
OL,18,Fcomplained of being left without vital
OL,19,Fletters causing them to miss hospital
OL,20,Fappointments and fines amid staffing
OL,21,Fshortages.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
