OL,3,GNEWSAMan waited months for cancer
OL,4,Aletter due to postal delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Royal Mail told the
OL,7,FBBC a national change to the way post
OL,8,Fis delivered was being rolled out
OL,9,Facross all delivery offices to meet
OL,10,Ftargets set by regulator Ofcom after
OL,11,Frepeated fines.
